  "description": "Born into a powerful shamanic bloodline, a young man possesses spiritual abilities he desperately wishes to escape. He tries every possible method to avoid inheriting the fate awaiting him, yet restless spirits continue to haunt his life. When he encounters a terrifying evil entity and narrowly avoids disaster, he is unexpectedly rescued by a kind-hearted stranger whose mysterious guardian spirit effortlessly devours the threat. Realizing this man may hold the key to severing his own supernatural ties, he draws closer with hidden intentions only to find himself entangled in a dangerous mix of destiny, secrets, and growing attraction.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/never_shaman)",
